cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use confdelta in your research, please cite it."
title: "confdelta: statistically rigorous comparison of two protein conformational ensembles"
abstract: >-
  confdelta compares two protein conformational ensembles per residue with
  effect sizes, confidence intervals and multiple-testing-corrected q-values,
  choosing a replicate-level permutation test when replicates are supplied and a
  block bootstrap over frames otherwise.
type: software
authors:
